[{"client_msg_id":"ca99f71a-9005-466f-80a2-77ce864be6f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"このテストは何を保証するためのテストなのか、というの、大事なんだけど普段あまり意識できていないなって思いました(小並感)","ts":"1619860440.274500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"deXOR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c156720-dbd9-41e9-a73a-cd83e9a6ef2f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"詳細仕様を決めるかの問題はあるけど、チームで粒度はレビューである程度は担保されてそうではある","ts":"1619860434.274300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iPdPi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8a070e0-da57-4e84-b487-741b353c8d91","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"TDDなのかBDDなのか的な話ですかね？","ts":"1619860386.273300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+AcTN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b617968-0156-468c-a711-16a6773b9703","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"誰がテストに何を求めてるのか、というのも重要そうですね","ts":"1619860299.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JD1Uk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faf2995f-ae75-4aea-85f7-4255f6d2b9b8","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"関数に切り出す際の粒度が人によって違うので結局そこで曖昧になる感じがする","ts":"1619860298.272800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TpJ6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09320e09-e20f-4a89-9b3e-03a2a4cbae10","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"プログラミングなにもわからない","ts":"1619860294.272700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OQkgF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"759e7183-c676-4971-b6c7-cd27589e0b51","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"その境界も結局曖昧なイメージ","ts":"1619860084.271400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oJcj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7477F140-1FB8-433A-B250-DD931320909A","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"プログラマがやりたいテストなのか？仕様のテストなのか？とか？\nここで話してるユニットテストはプログラマが「これ本当に動くんだろうか？」で書くテストでインテグレーションテストは「仕様的に正しいんだろうか？」で書くテストって聞こえます。","ts":"1619859911.271100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H8EdS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6485e4b-3100-4da8-ab4f-dbfffaf8b09a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"なるほどー完全な証明からスタートして何を許容してどういうケースを落とすのかみたいな視点でも何かまとまりそう \u0026gt; どの程度落とすのが適切","ts":"1619859591.267400","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1619859630.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HLlEK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e651c6e-c95d-460f-9ba1-2bf96f27bc4d","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"説明しようと思えばできるけど、毎回してると結構めんどくさい","ts":"1619859200.265800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GaF8f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dd15780-9a15-403b-90b2-e67eb6b7de0f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"設計よりもテストの方が感覚だよりなところありますよね・・・","ts":"1619859152.265300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BuuGh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b61434a-d73d-465c-864b-1bc7ce7ab325","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"外側ではテストの粒度を落としたりは気持ちするけど、どの程度落とすのが適切なのかはなにもわからない","ts":"1619859092.264600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7jhqD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58c42a4d-4510-4d9d-8d80-e1f4eba019ec","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"単に他にいい方法が思いつかないだけと言う話もある","ts":"1619859057.264100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YYgY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91f8f8ce-cf0b-42b3-9521-8223530898b6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"テストケース考える時間割くよりテストされているという最低限だけ担保して次の実装さっさと書くぜ、みたいな感じですかね?","ts":"1619858895.263700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yaC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06f18645-4caa-4315-a510-f90426d9eda1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"テスト内容被っとるやんけと思いつつ同じようなの書いちゃうのよくある…","ts":"1619858862.263000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UG6DF6W87","U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s4FGh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5676e62a-03e6-4453-98ac-1d464d081673","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"しゃーない…","ts":"1619858836.262200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lwytL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb452ce-1616-4799-8de6-11b274798b62","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"しゃーない?","ts":"1619858695.261900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W6BsI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aa309c8-ed4e-457b-8827-39e07ed6a6ef","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ちなみに thinca さんは多分 `Create()` のテストでも `validateName()` とか `save()` でテストされたテストケースを `Create()` でも使うって立場だと解釈してるんですが、ケースが被ってることについてはどう考えてますか?","ts":"1619858683.261600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0yhOX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"783d5397-439b-4f19-bb50-3841689932a9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いやまぁ `hoge` なんざテストケース列挙してても拾えないだろうからほんとうによくない例示だなｗ","ts":"1619858454.259800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aED"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66748a54-502e-458b-ba5c-aac44012be79","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、 `hoge` をはじく例はバグを埋め込む例として...ｗ\n// わかりにくいですねｗ","ts":"1619858384.259100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uNlCV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b328266a-805a-4ac3-948e-6ec586f38818","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私はこの場合だとhogeケースは書きますね。意図を感じるから。\n書きたくないならもうちょいうまいことどうにかしろって思います。","ts":"1619858305.258100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a3sy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0fdba12-a83a-4ef5-8066-5f7abaffb2c5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いくつか前提を決めてやった上ならある程度何がよいか決定できそうだな","ts":"1619858298.257800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GAZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b69c50d2-6a0f-4fab-823c-22f4f9485a45","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"とか言っちゃうと環境要因が大きすぎて全て状況による! って話になってあれだなｗ","ts":"1619858248.256800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y6Xf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb676e2-5876-4e43-9372-dd444cc2f05b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いかに逐次にテストされた処理を流れてるだけだとしてもわけわからんやつが\n```func Create(name string) error {\n  if name == \"hoge\" {\n    return errors.New(\"hoge は嫌い\")\n  }\n  err := validateName(name)\n  if err != nil {\n    return err\n  }\n  return save(Hoge{name})\n}```\nとか書いたらどうすんのよ! って言いながら全部のテストケース書きたい気持ちもあるし\nコードレビューである程度はじけるから OK/NG のマトリクスのみでよい、みたいな気持ちもある...","ts":"1619858099.255300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lyMn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9edd004e-0892-4b9b-94d1-d5f6da755a35","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"作った人がsaveの時にvalidateNameのエラーを返さないことも、うっかり握り潰しをしないことも信用できない(自分でも)ので","ts":"1619857794.251800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I0Oe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2075f017-fc3a-479e-8089-ad5ae56a46df","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"このサイズだとまあないですけど、ifでの判定ミスはあるあるなので、自動で流せるなら validateName,saveでの OK/NGマトリクスを流したいで、ちゃんと期待するエラーがかえるか?に意味があるのを確認したい\n(意味がないなら不要だけど)","ts":"1619857759.251100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MeI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8faa38b6-04cd-4453-97b3-87f2079f70c2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"Rust気軽にprivateテストできるからいい。privateテスト論議がなくなって","ts":"1619857738.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"74G=h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29123147-5c06-4b27-af61-3ff2dd85364a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"validateName,saveでテストされてるわけだから正常、異常の１パターンずつですね。私なら。\nprivateメソッドでのテストならまた話がややこしくなりそうだけど・・・","ts":"1619857585.248900","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1619857602.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zxit"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e099cb9-d51c-417f-aabe-4bbae128fb8e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うーん、モックできるならエラーパス大丈夫かユニットテストするけど\nそうじゃないなら、validateName,、saveはユニットでやって、こっちはシステムテストの実ケースで確認にさせてもらうかも\nこれも言語とフレームワークによるんですよね","ts":"1619857554.248600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YZ8H5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9a54561-cd1a-4f4f-8634-442da3db3461","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"テスト範囲の重複はあるあるだなぁ","ts":"1619857470.245200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7GLq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fb7d6e0-5aee-49f2-876e-64b4f5742fc2","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```func Create(name string) error {\n  err := validateName(name)\n  if err != nil {\n    return err\n  }\n  return save(Hoge{name})\n}```\nみたいな関数をテストしたくて `validateName()` と `save()` がいろんなケースの `name` でテスト書かれているとしてこの `Create()` のテストを書くときのテストケースはどうしますか?\nという問いにしたらどうでしょう\n// ユニット/インテグレーションというのはあえて書いてません","ts":"1619857386.244600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YeDs8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c572e09-ce9b-4c77-8028-caca326a9ab6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、各代表エラーケースタイプごとにやるのはなんとなくしっくりくるな","ts":"1619857208.241600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JR3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d4cd7d8-4684-4c75-8269-15b0ae71f079","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ合ってる気がしますね。実際ユニット、システムと食い合ってる部分もありますし","ts":"1619857157.240600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XIP4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f414dcf-3582-4daa-a21a-abc035f147fa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"全然わからんけど、このプロジェクトではこの部分のテストのことをインテグレーションテストと呼びましょう、くらいの意味しかないと言う結論に私の中で至った","ts":"1619857063.239100","thread_ts":"1619857063.239100","last_read":"1619883259.277800","subscribed":true,"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"03Qre"}]},{"client_msg_id":"487b9f05-2eea-4d61-9175-42fb8d69e811","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、たしかに正常と失敗で1ケースずつ、は極端でしたね\n異常系を1ケースずつ通せばいい、か","ts":"1619857050.238800","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1619857082.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZRvpG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c9d042e-7957-49c3-9901-8512c4412d23","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"インテグレーションは境界IFの結合確認とユースケースパス(の成功と失敗)あたりですかねえ\nさすがに制御フローとしてみても、1ケースづつはちょっと弱いのでは\nまあ、システムテストで網羅やるからいい、ならいいですが","ts":"1619856981.237700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UzVeQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae6dc274-dc72-4cad-90f9-c88d4411b17e","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":":yoshi:","ts":"1619856970.237400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yp5oE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e76c1546-9cbd-47b5-bfd4-4ef23626999a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"つまり制御フローをテストしたいんだよなたぶん","ts":"1619856926.236400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6jqIa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05d25fc1-0f2b-4386-b3ae-7d1242e0f71e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"インテグレーションっていったときには適当な正常に動作しそうなケースと失敗しそうなケースを1つずつくらいやっときゃいいかな、みたいな直感があるんですが、どうでしょ?","ts":"1619856901.235900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sid0m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1a72e4e-5551-44aa-915e-72ac25083bc6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"vimのプラグインだとNode側で関数単位でしか書いてなくて、ユニットテストだよなーとは思ってます\nVim scriptとNode連携させたらインテグレーションだと思うんですが","ts":"1619856820.234500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+6LuK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a9dca69-4ac0-4cea-9430-41dbfa43a403","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、RESTの応答とかを、応答の直接の処理部以外をモックしないでやるときはユニットテスト感ないなあ、とは思ったりした。そうそう動かないからしょうがないかもしれないが。","ts":"1619856751.233600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gD/NL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58d1c4d2-b767-44a8-bd08-ca38b3a092b6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"目的意識とか確認したいものによると思うんですが...","ts":"1619856713.232700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QY4A6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c5c0ec1-afd5-486b-8b15-001c1c00222e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"違いを意識すると最適なテストケースがうまく抽出できるという直感があってその辺りなんかいい資料ないかなーって思ってます","ts":"1619856709.232600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UGDDb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a8674d3-f616-432a-9878-4d8f6771e889","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もうぜんぶ「テスト」でいいじゃん、という","ts":"1619856698.232100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"goi7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae7ad9f7-3b4c-4bbb-9678-fe6dd7156313","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"インテグレーションテストの粒度にいろいろな解釈がありうるなら、テストを「ユニットテスト」と「インテグレーションテスト」で分けて呼ぶことによってなんのメリットが有るのだろう？という疑問はあります。","ts":"1619856667.231400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DjW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b9a1c8f-f8ca-4ea8-b539-a15db059c054","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なので「私は意識する」と言うよりかは「私が今関わっているプロジェクトでは意識する必要がある」かなぁと言う気がしました\nVim プラグインのテストを書いていて、ユニットテストレベル、インテグテストレベル、システムテストレベルくらいまで意識しますか?","ts":"1619856647.230700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UxFL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f67cfcfd-103b-4537-a0d5-28713dee4494","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"クラウドのSDKでDNSレコードいじってnslookupするっていうテスト書いたことあるな","ts":"1619856591.229000","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1619856644.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+9ya"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63df9888-9398-44eb-91cd-aaad45f6c31d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶんフレームワークにも依存する話な気がします。","ts":"1619856548.228400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EnE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22c2f7af-0e42-49f8-be23-9ae923c08a1f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私意識しますね〜少なくともユニットテストレベル、インテグテストレベル、システムテストレベルくらいまでは意識してる気がします","ts":"1619856525.227900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RM6J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"234de611-5176-4ca1-ada8-e5a096cdc3be","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも「これはインテグレーションテストだ」と意識してテストを書いたことがただの1度もない","ts":"1619856473.226500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cUaUb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0634606e-4afb-4839-bf4c-59f6b5679a48","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"話がうまく食い合わなかったことが腑に落ちた。具体的な話を1つもしてないのでそりゃ話も合わんわ","ts":"1619856407.225400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7nnP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06789041-6d70-45e8-9807-7415c2ff6756","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ハンドラのテストも \"組み合わせをテストしたい\" と思った瞬間にインテグレーションテストなんですよたぶん","ts":"1619856395.224800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WDkp9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0162b68c-ac96-457d-8d7b-da145e0ccd39","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ユニット(関数など)が結合してシステムとして一体として動作するレベルのテストはインテグレーションだと思います。\n大規模とは基準が違うというか...","ts":"1619856346.223600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2qQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86383cf0-61d9-4047-9193-c2cade0039fa","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"インテグレーションって言うときには組み合わせたい物が存在するのはそうで、そのときの組み合わせたい物というものは人によって粒度を自由に設定できるので無限に解釈が生まれますね","ts":"1619856342.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U8CC7MDCL"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":f