000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QV0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9606d753-1a9a-468b-bc6b-9c11b8311c62","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"少なくとも Rails には「これはインテグレーションテストです」というのはない印象です","ts":"1619855731.210300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tawem"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1525210e-bd48-49f9-8d64-5b8e22bd2bfe","type":"message","user":"UNM8AVCB0","text":"dbに触れると遅くになりますね。\nでも Rails は ActiveRecord に依存すぎて DB なしのテストは面倒です。","ts":"1619855710.209800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rq7D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17b9a76c-0423-4c43-b8b7-c431701d43b7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私の認識はtennashiさんと近いですね","ts":"1619855702.209600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o5dW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35875fb8-d346-4cf5-954e-ae7a0f64e957","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"Rustだと testsディレクトリ以下な認識","ts":"1619855667.208500","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1619855807.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iNJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88f399b4-34f6-48b2-bf02-b4bc1c85759e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ユニットテストは手元と CI で走ってインテグレーションテストは CI (設定すれば手元でも) 走る、ですかね","ts":"1619855666.208300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zwmQd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"860925bd-71a8-44d5-8cd2-ff1cc1089fd8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ユニットテストとインテグレーションテストの違いをよくわかってない","ts":"1619855663.208200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k02"}]},{"client_msg_id":"801c571c-d8b0-479c-9456-a35399a562f8","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私は普通にCIで動かしてますね。","ts":"1619855645.207100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DKg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2599df83-958d-4099-8889-adb6900a6d16","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"インテグレーションテストのことをよくわかってないんですが、ユニットテストは CI で走ると思うんですけどインテグレーションテストはいつ実行するやつなんですか?","ts":"1619855613.206300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1MV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b42fa875-9280-44db-a51b-4bdfd72526db","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"（なんでGW初日からテストについて話してるんだろう・・・）","ts":"1619855594.205800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U3l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee9d116a-5296-45ca-8ffd-ca4fdbe62488","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"インテグレーションテスト… Rails のプロジェクトで書いてるところあるのかな","ts":"1619855531.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tc/Sa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac6d7808-f626-412a-90aa-dcc26ab5b6f9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"元の記事は DB へのデータ登録自体をテストするのはユニットテストではなくインテグレーションテストなどで担保しようねという主張ですね // コメントも参照\nつまりユニットテストではモックもしなければ実データも使わない","ts":"1619855464.202500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CZFvB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e79a348-3757-4a53-8fad-e25309ffe3dc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ユニットテストとして、DBのデータを読んだ体で、渡す必要がある、みたいな感じなのかな","ts":"1619855291.200800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pm0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"033585ee-e11f-484b-9e39-5be3606b448f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"文化の違いだ","ts":"1619855244.199000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"srz7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8217f24c-5a2c-4135-8579-b02796843167","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"本物相当は私は小さいユニットテストレベルだと使わないですね。システム全体的なやつだと使いますけど","ts":"1619855224.198700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vUrO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d461e2a-8571-48a2-8778-af171fd6453f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも DB をモックするということをやったことがない。テストでも本物の DB を使うことが多いと思います。","ts":"1619855177.197300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eW2zS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01655a39-2b86-450a-8341-43b645f1729a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私は逆にRails知らんですね・・・","ts":"1619855150.196500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zTI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9873bfc0-7ad6-46ea-8b6e-f7525500e49f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は Rails しかわからんので Rails を想像していました","ts":"1619855136.196000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LNGb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"248b415a-8a6e-48e9-9f22-2db4a067b18c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"テストも人によってさまざまだから誤解しやすいな...","ts":"1619855115.195300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R/12"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6505cdd9-ff40-48cb-8e8a-69d3b0e4b227","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶんお互いに想像している前提が全然違う感じがする","ts":"1619855113.195200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Saa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43b1bff0-9152-4bab-84e8-54ecc27f276c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私はユニットテストの話しですね","ts":"1619855094.194100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1c/La"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29dac8fc-d686-4f19-b361-cf51035d0f08","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、ユニットテストの話ではない?","ts":"1619855077.193600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"66D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4e1adbf-40f9-4d3d-b883-e1bc9b954190","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"だからDBモック使わずに外部からDIできるような形がいいって話しだと思ってます。","ts":"1619855055.192400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xlO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4095d2d-152e-4365-91b5-c9453273a35b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"テストコードではそれはできないですよね","ts":"1619855038.191700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1bD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"661de46a-d4c6-4c1c-a4f3-3f6601704082","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"実際の DB 使ってれば適当に運用したステージング環境の dump をそのまま持ってくるみたいな工夫の余地はあったりしますけどね","ts":"1619855024.190900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hU8A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"063c0e67-9d94-4c37-a361-cdf988216a01","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"はい、つらいです…。そしてそれはモックだろうが実際の DB だろうがつらいと言う認識です。","ts":"1619854986.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cea3a29-af0a-4682-8c05-6fb068e4a814","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"うーんよくわからないですけど、DBのデータを人間が作るのつらくないですか・・？私はつらい。","ts":"1619854941.189100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p3p2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bae2b629-27a3-4b28-b7f6-1c22d3cf141c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それはモックをしたから辛くなる部分ですよね。テストデータを用意する部分についてはあまり変わらないイメージでした","ts":"1619854836.187200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"saqg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"930cd22f-7f65-4e29-acad-34011ec23052","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"なんというかテストデータ作るだけならテストターゲットに対してデータをうまく作るってところに注力できるんですけど、モックしたデータベースだとそれ以外のところに時間割くことが多くなる印象なんですよね。","ts":"1619854763.186000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"76LsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4a39a79-34ee-4331-b824-4169c6b7d9e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"DB をモックしたことがあまりないのでわからないですが、モックしなくてもテストデータの作成は複雑になる気がしますねー","ts":"1619854663.183600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SgsD2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dce100d-59d4-495f-a6cb-589543df6ab8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、なりやすいというか、ほぼそうなるというか","ts":"1619854570.182800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nkd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d0b901f-b5a9-4cfd-864c-f19a965d9c48","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"おっと私に対してか（CHOさんがrandomに貼ったやつにクソリプ飛ばすので忙しかった）。DBモックしたときってテストデータ作るの複雑にならないですか？リレーションとか維持しつつ作る必要があるから。私はそうなる傾向にありますね。","ts":"1619854520.182300","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1619854827.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6j=4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"978de8d9-1a03-4d11-bc7f-51d022a5b44e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いわゆるテーブルテストなんかは機能的凝集なコードをテストするのに最適に思えるんですけど、じゃあユースケースみたいな時間的凝集のコードをテーブルテストして本当に意味あるの?? みたいなことを思っていて、それで\n\u0026gt; 誰か凝集度とそれに応じたテストみたいな感じのまとめ作ってないですかねぇ\nみたいなコメントを...","ts":"1619854060.176700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4a3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9401dd7f-46d6-4968-b092-6c4576164268","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"DB をモックするかどうかとテストデータを作るかどうかって関係あるんです?","ts":"1619854055.176500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e760c838-4075-4030-bbfa-dfb1380170d6","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"DBのモックひたすらテストデータ作るのがだるくなるイメージしかない","ts":"1619854029.175600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NP7be"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe507f34-71e0-406a-a95a-6b4ab4d9d440","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほどわかりやすい","ts":"1619854014.175100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2D2Nk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40b07c87-0fc7-47e8-8feb-4b4d91b609f4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"最初に貼った記事は \"ユニットテストにおいて\" データベースをモックなんざするな、機能的凝集を見出してその関数をテストしろ、みたいなことを言ってる","ts":"1619853941.174000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qzfE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cfd1d56-c387-4c83-a5d9-0c4d662401af","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ユースケースを記述するコードなんかは時間的凝集なコードにならざるを得ないんですよね","ts":"1619853870.172200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/L2l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a867fcc1-a0a5-419a-a8e8-58a92efba7e7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、つごう色々組込みもやった人間からすると、関数として呼び出すわけにいかないタイミングでいろいろなものを順次処理(初期化とか)が必要になったりもよくあるので、スライドにあるように必要に合せて、範囲を限定して作るとかうまくやる必要がある","ts":"1619853787.171000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JhnS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd2d8eeb-212a-4a59-8890-87c92f46ab96","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、ほかの言い方でいいのがあまりない\n機能が明確簡潔で分かり易い、状態をもたない/副作用がない(これは関数型言語とかで強いところ)だとテストしやすいんですが","ts":"1619853729.169800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=vfmI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d20cdade-a6ac-44e8-aa50-7d48829d116d","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"それは確かにｗ \u0026gt; 凝集","ts":"1619853720.169500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D0V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2643793-804a-47ee-86c2-5c8299ba36d4","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ここらへんってSIerが好む言葉なんですよね","ts":"1619853697.169000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cor07"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00cdb5c8-ad6a-4202-9d0f-5a27d65eb0a9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まず凝集と言う単語が馴染みがなさすぎて意味がわからないと言うのがある","ts":"1619853672.167400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FxwY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14147391-dfe6-4593-91e9-011bb0b4007f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"何々して、何々して....みたいな思考でコードを書いてるとき -\u0026gt; 時間的凝集なコードを書いてる、このときの \"何々して\" の部分一つ一つを括り出せばそれらはより機能的凝集に近くなってる\n何々のときは何々して...みたいな思考でコードを書いてるとき -\u0026gt; 論理的凝集なコードを書いてる、このときの \"何々して\" の部分を括り出せばそれはより機能的凝集に近くなってる\nみたいな...","ts":"1619853639.166700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QcFYR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8c0f456-cb63-4731-84d0-3155667c665f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"とにかくざっくりいうと、細切れにしてテストしやすくしとけばいいって認識\nなんかテストが複雑になったり書きにくくなったりしたらちょっと設計見直してみようよってくらいで普通はOKのはず","ts":"1619853462.164000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Flx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c18593a-ef52-4d06-96ab-2f4d0d0d5c18","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分の読解力のなさ","ts":"1619853118.162200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ocL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ca69371-c8e0-4aab-a709-63ddf82b4ef8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ、なんどか読んだんすけど、よくわからんかったんすよね…","ts":"1619853111.162000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cm1mG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44930a8a-fed2-4916-9fdd-dc08371e51d7","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"// こないだついったーにまた流れてきてたのですっと出てきましたｗ","ts":"1619852707.161700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O/cyF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6ff1da0-d0bd-4cac-9ccf-580389c771b5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://speakerdeck.com/sonatard/coheision-coupling\u003e\n凝集度を Go の実例とともに解説してほしい、そんなあなたに","ts":"1619852640.161100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Speaker Deck: オブジェクト指向のその前に-凝集度と結合度/Coheision-Coupling","id":1,"title":"オブジェクト指向のその前に-凝集度と結合度/Coheision-Coupling","title_link":"https://speakerdeck.com/sonatard/coheision-coupling","image_url":"https://files.speakerdeck.com/presentations/87050fae114d4f60b66eebfc89e57a1e/slide_0.jpg?14969479","blocks":null,"service_name":"Speaker Deck","service_icon":"https://d1eu30co0ohy4w.cloudfront.net/assets/favicon-c0fe5475f88a65b817c8cc7c0fedc01b7acc17fe27628fa13ca3f96e56e16977.png","from_url":"https://speakerdeck.com/sonatard/coheision-coupling","original_url":"https://speakerdeck.com/sonatard/coheision-coupling"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e0p4A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39392378-c221-4531-b1ee-29fc780129da","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"誰かGoのコードで説明してほしい...","ts":"1619852449.160100","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1619852453.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oWx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ab0f357-d6d6-4352-82ba-dc694c14b9cf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"凝集度とかよくわからない…","ts":"1619852444.159900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OWcSQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e18e615f-883b-4d8d-99ec-1b7ea9ffc73c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://qvault.io/clean-code/writing-good-unit-tests-dont-mock-database-connections/\u003e\nいい話だった\n誰か凝集度とそれに応じたテストみたいな感じのまとめ作ってないですかねぇ","ts":"1619851911.159500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qvault: Writing Good Unit Tests; Don't Mock Database Connections - Qvault","id":1,"title":"Writing Good Unit Tests; Don't Mock Database Connections - Qvault","title_link":"https://qvault.io/clean-code/writing-good-unit-tests-dont-mock-database-connections/","text":"Unit tests are unbelievably important to us as developers because they allow us to demonstrate the correctness of the code we've written. More importantly,","image_url":"https://qvault.io/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Writing-Good-Unit-Tests-Dont-Use-Database-Mocking-1024x576.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qvault","service_icon":"https://qvault.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/cropped-qvault-logo-1-180x180.png","from_url":"https://qvault.io/clean-code/writing-good-unit-tests-dont-mock-database-connections/","original_url":"https://qvault.io/clean-code/writing-good-unit-tests-dont-mock-database-connections/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eHM5"}]}]
